msgid "For the component articulations, Health Ministries, Development Partners, and Clinical, Patient, Community, and Civil-Society readers may be best served by the plain-language framing in Section 2.1, the REDDHI and full-STAC overview in Section 2.2, and the component summaries in Section 3.5 rather than reading every individual component entry in Appendix C. Health-service delivery organisations (such as hospital groups, provider networks, and facility operators) should combine the Enterprise Architects & Technical Teams path with Section 4.5 depending on whether their focus is clinical governance or technical integration at the national-to-facility boundary."
